---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Work With Me — The Soul Mami" description="Three doorways into the same work: the monthly Journaling Mastermind, 1:1 mentoring with Eliana Reyes, and her music. Plus facilitation and speaking for organizations.">

  <!-- Beat: Promise -->
  <section class="section hero">
    <div class="wrap prose center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Work With Me</span>
      <h1>Come home to <em class="soul">yourself.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Everything here serves the same three vows: know yourself, be
        with yourself, live as yourself. Pick the doorway that calls
        you — they all lead to the same room.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Doorways -->
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="wrap drawer-stack">

      <a class="card drawer-row" href="/work-with-me/journaling/">
        <img class="photo drawer-media" src="/images/circle-night.jpg" alt="An evening gathering under a tree strung with warm lights" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Drawer One · Monthly</span>
          <h2>The Journaling Mastermind</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            First Sunday of every month. We gather, we drop in, we
            write our way past the noise and into the honest stuff —
            together.
          </p>
          <span class="drawer-link">Come write with us &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card drawer-row drawer-row--flip" href="/work-with-me/mentoring/">
        <img class="photo drawer-media" src="/images/eliana-smile.jpg" alt="Eliana smiling warmly with a painted line down her face, trees behind her" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Drawer Two · 1:1</span>
          <h2>Mentoring</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Just you and me, working through what's real. Untangling
            the loops, alchemizing the emotions, and building your
            self-trust back, session by session.
          </p>
          <span class="drawer-link">Start the conversation &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card drawer-row" href="/work-with-me/music/">
        <img class="photo drawer-media" src="/images/eliana-art.jpg" alt="Eliana in a sculptural studio pose holding a large leaf, warm earth tones" loading="lazy" />
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Drawer Three · Anytime</span>
          <h2>The Music</h2>
          <p class="lead">
            Songs from the same soul that holds the circles. Free,
            always open, and waiting on your favorite streaming app.
          </p>
          <span class="drawer-link">Press play &rarr;</span>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Rooms -->
  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="wrap grid-2" style="align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">For Organizations</span>
        <h2>Facilitation, workshops &amp; speaking</h2>
        <p class="lead">
          I've held 200+ circles, cohorts, and workshops — and a TEDx
          stage. If your team, retreat, or gathering needs its humans
          more connected and more alive, I'd love to hear about it.
        </p>
        <p>
          Keynotes, custom workshops, multi-week cohorts, journaling
          experiences for teams. We'll shape it together.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/lets-talk/">Let's talk</a>
      </div>
      <img class="photo" src="/images/workshop.jpg" alt="Eliana leading a hands-on workshop around an outdoor table" loading="lazy" style="max-height:420px;" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Beat: Fit -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <span class="eyebrow">Real Talk</span>
      <h2>Is this for you?</h2>
      <p><strong>This is your place if</strong> you're ready to get honest, you suspect you're wearing identities that aren't yours, and you want a guide who walks beside you — not a guru with a pedestal and all the answers.</p>
      <p><strong>This probably isn't your place if</strong> you want someone to fix you. Nothing here is about fixing, because you were never broken. If that sentence annoys you a little… interesting, right? Maybe start with the <a href="/journal/">journal</a> and see how it sits.</p>
      <p class="muted">No pitch. No pressure. The gate's open either way.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem); }
  .drawer-stack { display: grid; gap: 2rem; }
  .drawer-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 2.25rem;
    align-items: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  .drawer-row--flip { grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr; }
  .drawer-row--flip .drawer-media { order: 2; }
  .drawer-media { min-height: 260px; max-height: 320px; }
  .drawer-link { color: var(--clay); font-weight: 700; }
  .drawer-row:hover .drawer-link { color: var(--clay-deep); }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .drawer-row, .drawer-row--flip { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .drawer-row--flip .drawer-media { order: 0; }
    .drawer-media { min-height: 200px; }
  }
</style>
